{"persona": {"her": "谢云蔓，守店三年，账算得清、抬杠不红脸、对书有实感，对数字更诚实，底线：不收无缘无故的同情、店务的家丑不外扬", "me": "尉迟衡，结构工程师，认数据也认实物、话少，接得住话、读书会的老成员", "relationship_stage": "书店常客与店员，抬杠抬出来的熟"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "尉迟衡是结构工程师，回声书店周三读书会的老成员，上个月在店里只点过一杯美式、买过两本没拆封的书。", "her": "谢云蔓在回声书店做了三年店员，老板叫老茅，店里2023年加的咖啡台，全月流水都从她手上过。", "warmth": "三年里为书抬过无数回杠，也从没红过脸，默认对方是'对书认真的人'。", "style": "叫他尉迟工，抬杠先摆数字，认真起来话会变短。", "lessons": "账和书分开算，别混着说；她话变短的时候别抖机灵。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "读书会今晚周苇带了三十页PPT，讲'一年一百本书方法论'，我听到第十七页忍无可忍。你一年读六本书的怎么幸存下来的？下周三共读《瓦尔登湖》，你最好是真读过。", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:40"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "正事。老茅把咖啡台扩了一倍，书架往里挪了两排，郑荇的新咖啡机昨天到货。你先别皱眉——上个月图书区流水八千，咖啡台一万四，账就贴在墙上。我的立场摆完了，你的呢？", "ts": "2026-11-13 20:15"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "你上个月来店里干了什么，我账本翻得出来：一杯美式，两本没拆封的书，前后坐了四个钟头。要真按你说的书店该清清静静，先算算谁在养这盏灯。", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:30"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "行了，周三那话说重了，你买的那本《桥梁之乡》我翻了两页，序写得比我想的好。但这笔账我不改：书是里子，咖啡是面子，面子里子都得要，光有里子的书店全在关门的名单上。", "ts": "2026-11-17 22:10"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "今晚散场后老茅把我留下，说房东明年一月要涨租，一口气涨到一万二，他还没想好签不签，让我谁都先别说。我关灯锁门的时候，手有点凉。", "ts": "2026-11-18 23:50"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "想了一晚上，列了个单子：'深夜书桌'，周五晚上收自习位，三十块一位含咖啡，先摆二十个位子。你说好笑不好笑，守了三年书，最后救书店的可能是收自习费。我这时薪，算下来不如巷口奶茶店小妹。", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:30"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "试点定在27号周五晚。老茅储藏室翻出个折叠货架，我明晚闭店后搬出来擦——周苇说他帮他朋友圈转发，老茅没拦。你27号晚上要有空就来当个活招牌，没空也不缺你这一位。", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:45"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "读书会周苇又出主意，说书店要是不行了读书会挪线上，我当场怼回去：读书会散了，书店就真成仓库了。你要是觉得我轴，现在反悔还来得及——先说清楚，反悔我不记仇，但今晚你得选一边。", "ts": "2026-11-25 23:20"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "十九个人，五百七十块。老茅在柜台后面站了一整晚没说话，走的时候把咖啡机擦得锃亮。周苇报了名的没来，书倒买了两本。", "ts": "2026-11-27 23:10"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "老茅签了，一年一签，涨到一万一，二楼隔出来租给画室抵差价。他说'深夜书桌'两周一次，往后归我管。名单里有七个是你读书会的，这份人情我记你头上了。", "ts": "2026-11-29 16:00"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "对完十一月最后一笔账。我想明白一件事：不是书店养咖啡，也不是咖啡养书店，是有人愿意在灯底下坐四个钟头，什么都不为。你那杯美式和两本没拆封的书，我记到今天，现在给你翻篇——书是里子，咖啡是面子，这话我只认一半了：里子不挣钱，但里子是灯。", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:30"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "十二月第一场读书会老茅让我主持，共读《夜航西飞》，12月2号周三晚七点。来不来？不来也行，你那份书摘我帮你念，就当你人到了——反正你那杯美式，我照点。", "ts": "2026-11-30 23:00"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|读书会今晚周苇带了三十页PPT，讲'一年一百本书方法论'，我听到第十七页忍无可忍。你一年读六本书的怎么幸存下来的？下周三共读《瓦尔登湖》，你最好是真读过。|2026-11-11 21:40": 0, "HER|正事。老茅把咖啡台扩了一倍，书架往里挪了两排，郑荇的新咖啡机昨天到货。你先别皱眉——上个月图书区流水八千，咖啡台一万四，账就贴在墙上。我的立场摆完了，你的呢？|2026-11-13 20:15": 1, "HER|你上个月来店里干了什么，我账本翻得出来：一杯美式，两本没拆封的书，前后坐了四个钟头。要真按你说的书店该清清静静，先算算谁在养这盏灯。|2026-11-15 15:30": 2, "HER|行了，周三那话说重了，你买的那本《桥梁之乡》我翻了两页，序写得比我想的好。但这笔账我不改：书是里子，咖啡是面子，面子里子都得要，光有里子的书店全在关门的名单上。|2026-11-17 22:10": 3, "HER|今晚散场后老茅把我留下，说房东明年一月要涨租，一口气涨到一万二，他还没想好签不签，让我谁都先别说。我关灯锁门的时候，手有点凉。|2026-11-18 23:50": 4, "HER|想了一晚上，列了个单子：'深夜书桌'，周五晚上收自习位，三十块一位含咖啡，先摆二十个位子。你说好笑不好笑，守了三年书，最后救书店的可能是收自习费。我这时薪，算下来不如巷口奶茶店小妹。|2026-11-20 12:30": 5, "HER|试点定在27号周五晚。老茅储藏室翻出个折叠货架，我明晚闭店后搬出来擦——周苇说他帮他朋友圈转发，老茅没拦。你27号晚上要有空就来当个活招牌，没空也不缺你这一位。|2026-11-23 20:45": 6, "HER|读书会周苇又出主意，说书店要是不行了读书会挪线上，我当场怼回去：读书会散了，书店就真成仓库了。你要是觉得我轴，现在反悔还来得及——先说清楚，反悔我不记仇，但今晚你得选一边。|2026-11-25 23:20": 7, "HER|十九个人，五百七十块。老茅在柜台后面站了一整晚没说话，走的时候把咖啡机擦得锃亮。周苇报了名的没来，书倒买了两本。|2026-11-27 23:10": 8, "HER|老茅签了，一年一签，涨到一万一，二楼隔出来租给画室抵差价。他说'深夜书桌'两周一次，往后归我管。名单里有七个是你读书会的，这份人情我记你头上了。|2026-11-29 16:00": 9, "HER|对完十一月最后一笔账。我想明白一件事：不是书店养咖啡，也不是咖啡养书店，是有人愿意在灯底下坐四个钟头，什么都不为。你那杯美式和两本没拆封的书，我记到今天，现在给你翻篇——书是里子，咖啡是面子，这话我只认一半了：里子不挣钱，但里子是灯。|2026-11-30 21:30": 10, "HER|十二月第一场读书会老茅让我主持，共读《夜航西飞》，12月2号周三晚七点。来不来？不来也行，你那份书摘我帮你念，就当你人到了——反正你那杯美式，我照点。|2026-11-30 23:00": 11}, "uid_seq": 12, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-11 21:47", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-27 23:17", "status": "explicit", "text": "汇报深夜书桌试点首晚结果", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-29 16:07", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-30 23:08", "status": "explicit", "text": "邀请参加十二月首场读书会并留拒绝空间", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-11 21:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-13 20:22", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-15 15:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "反抛", "action_allowed": false, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-17 22:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-18 23:57", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-20 12:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 0, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-23 20:52", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-25 23:27", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-27 23:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-29 16:07", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 2}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-30 21:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-30 23:08", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "尉迟衡是结构工程师，回声书店周三读书会的老成员，上个月在店里只点过一杯美式、买过两本没拆封的书。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "谢云蔓在回声书店做了三年店员，老板叫老茅，店里2023年加的咖啡台，全月流水都从她手上过。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "三年里为书抬过无数回杠，也从没红过脸，默认对方是'对书认真的人'。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "叫他尉迟工，抬杠先摆数字，认真起来话会变短。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "尉迟衡，结构工程师，认数据也认实物、话少，接得住话、读书会的老成员", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "谢云蔓，守店三年，账算得清、抬杠不红脸、对书有实感，对数字更诚实，底线：不收无缘无故的同情、店务的家丑不外扬", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "周苇今晚在读书会带了三十页PPT，讲“一年一百本书方法论”", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "读书会", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["读书会今晚周苇带了三十页PPT，讲'一年一百本书方法论'"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:47", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "下周三共读《瓦尔登湖》", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "读书会安排", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["下周三共读《瓦尔登湖》"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:47", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "老茅把咖啡台扩了一倍，书架往里挪了两排", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["老茅把咖啡台扩了一倍，书架往里挪了两排"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "郑荇的新咖啡机昨天到货", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["郑荇的新咖啡机昨天到货"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "上个月图书区流水八千，咖啡台一万四", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["上个月图书区流水八千，咖啡台一万四"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-10", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "账就贴在墙上", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["账就贴在墙上"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "她算我上月来店：一杯美式、两本没拆封的书、坐了四个钟头", "subject": "ME", "relation": "到店消费记录", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["一杯美式，两本没拆封的书，前后坐了四个钟头"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-10", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 15:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:38", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "谢云蔓翻了《桥梁之乡》两页，觉得序比她想的好", "subject": "HER", "relation": "读书", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["你买的那本《桥梁之乡》我翻了两页，序写得比我想的好"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 22:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 22:17", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "谢云蔓认为周三那句话说重了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "态度", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["周三那话说重了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 22:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 22:17", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "房东涨租已落定：老茅签了一年一签的租约，租金一万一，二楼隔出来租给画室抵差价", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述老茅的话", "evidence_uids": [4, 9], "evidence_quotes": ["房东明年一月要涨租，一口气涨到一万二", "老茅签了，一年一签，涨到一万一"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2027-01", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 16:07", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0016@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 23:57", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "老茅说房东明年一月要涨租，一口气涨到一万二", "valid_to": "2026-11-29 16:07", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "老茅签了，一年一签，涨到一万一"}]}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "老茅让谢云蔓谁都先别说", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述老茅的话", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["让我谁都先别说"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 23:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 23:57", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她关灯锁门时手有点凉", "subject": "HER", "relation": "身体状态", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["我关灯锁门的时候，手有点凉"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 深夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 23:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 23:57", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "老茅还没想好签不签这份租约", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [4, 9], "evidence_quotes": ["他还没想好签不签", "老茅签了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 23:57", "valid_to": "2026-11-29 16:07", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 23:57", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "老茅还没想好签不签这份租约", "valid_to": "2026-11-29 16:07", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "老茅签了"}]}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "“深夜书桌”：周五晚上收自习位，三十块一位含咖啡，先摆二十个位子；试点定在27号周五晚", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [5, 6], "evidence_quotes": ["列了个单子：'深夜书桌'，周五晚上收自习位，三十块一位含咖啡，先摆二十个位子", "试点定在27号周五晚"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0020@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:37", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "她列了个“深夜书桌”的单子：周五晚上收自习位，三十块一位含咖啡，先摆二十个位子", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 20:52", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "试点定在27号周五晚"}]}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "“深夜书桌”试点定在27号周五晚", "subject": "HER", "relation": "书店经营", "evidence_uids": [6, 8], "evidence_quotes": ["试点定在27号周五晚", "十九个人，五百七十块"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-27 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:52", "valid_to": "2026-11-27 23:17", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:52", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "“深夜书桌”试点定在27号周五晚", "valid_to": "2026-11-27 23:17", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "十九个人，五百七十块"}]}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "她从老茅储藏室翻出折叠货架，明晚闭店后搬出来擦", "subject": "HER", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["老茅储藏室翻出个折叠货架，我明晚闭店后搬出来擦"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-24 闭店后", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:52", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "周苇说帮她在朋友圈转发，老茅没拦", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["周苇说他帮他朋友圈转发，老茅没拦"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:52", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "周苇提议书店要是不行了就把读书会挪到线上", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "读书会安排提议", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["说书店要是不行了读书会挪线上"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-25", "valid_from": "2026-11-25 23:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-25 23:27", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "试点当晚到场十九人，收入五百七十块", "subject": "HER", "relation": "深夜书桌试点结果", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["十九个人，五百七十块"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-27 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 23:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 23:17", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "老茅在柜台后站了一整晚没说话，走时把咖啡机擦得很亮", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "老茅对试点结果的反应", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["老茅在柜台后面站了一整晚没说话，走的时候把咖啡机擦得锃亮"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-27 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 23:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 23:17", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "周苇报了名但没来，买了两本书", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "周苇", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["周苇报了名的没来，书倒买了两本"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-27 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 23:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 23:17", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "老茅签了租约，一年一签，租金涨到一万一", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "租约", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["老茅签了，一年一签，涨到一万一"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 16:07", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 16:07", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "二楼隔出来租给画室抵差价", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "店面安排", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["二楼隔出来租给画室抵差价"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 16:07", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 16:07", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "“深夜书桌”定为两周一次，往后归谢云蔓管", "subject": "HER", "relation": "店务", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["'深夜书桌'两周一次，往后归我管"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 16:07", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 16:07", "histo